<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπορ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cause to go before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				10.22
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, with aor.
			
				Med.
			, <i>go before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				23.10
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					844b5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				7.40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸ προσώπου τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					32.34
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				1.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸ τοῦ στρατοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.15.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐπὶ δὔ ἡμέραις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.52.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ προπορευόμενοι</span> the
				<i>van,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.27.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ προπορευομένη,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόπολος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Seleuc.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.267c
			</span></i>; of a river, <i>flow onward,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>(v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>come forward,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.80.8
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be promoted, advance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν στρατηγίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					28.6.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.4.2
			</span></i>.</div>
